	affiliations = {China Southern Power Grid, Guangzhou, Guangdong, China; CSG Digital Power Grid Group Company Ltd., Guangzhou, China},
	abstract = {Currently, the automatic generation method of regional warehouse replenishment scheme is generally implemented independently. The automatic generation of the scheme is slow, resulting in a gradual increase in the final relative error. Therefore, the design of automatic generation method of regional warehouse replenishment scheme based on Eclat algorithm is proposed. According to the current measurement, first collect the regional warehouse replenishment data, use association rules as guidance, improve the speed of automatic generation of the scheme, and combine Eclat algorithm mining to set association rules. Based on this, the automatic generation model of Eclat algorithm regional warehouse replenishment scheme is constructed, and the generation scheme is optimized by tracking and correction processing. The test results show that for the selected five warehouse test groups, combined with the comparative test of the two stages, the final relative error between the actual replenishment and the predicted replenishment is less than 1.25 words, indicating that with the help and support of the Eclat algorithm, the automatic generation mode of the designed regional warehouse replenishment scheme is more flexible and changeable, and has strong stability and reliability. In different environments, the application of Eclat algorithm can also minimize the calculation error of automatic generation and enhance the authenticity and stability of the generated results. © 2024 ACM.},
