	abstract = {One major issue that needs to be addressed in the twenty-first century is the smart warehouse. This paper examines the technologies used in smart warehousing from the perspective of the logistics 4.0 era. This paper suggests a technique for building smart warehouses that is built on Industry 4.0 technologies in an effort to improve the logistic system's overall operational efficiency. Potential gains were noted when a suggestion to develop a tested product with high quality and tools was made. These improvements included flawless and high-quality operations, technology tools to enhance logistical tasks, a decrease in the degree of human participation required in the process, higher productivity, and proof of operational faults. Qualitative research methodology was applied in this investigation. This article aims to define the smart warehouse and explore the benefits of having a flawlessly quality smart warehouse in the logistics era. Additionally, students will learn about smart warehouses via this research paper in two separate ways: first, they will learn about logistics, and then they will learn about smart warehouses. © 2024 IEEE.},
