	abstract = {Logistics, warehousing, factory workshops and other requirements for automation and intelligence are constantly improving. AGV, as a modern transportation tool, can be well applied in these production and transportation scenarios with its high-precision positioning function and intelligent path planning. In recent years, the rapid growth of warehousing and logistics industry is no longer a problem that can be solved by increasing personnel. The efficient and accurate operation efficiency of AGV solves this situation well. This paper discusses the existing path planning algorithm and positioning navigation technology, analyzes the advantages and disadvantages of the path planning algorithm and related sensors, discusses its suitable application scenarios, and summarizes the problem of AGV power management, which is less studied today. This paper aims to analyze and discuss the requirements of AGV positioning and navigation modes and path planning in different scenarios, and give some suggestions on the application of AGV system. © 2021 AIIPCC 2021 - 2nd International Conference on Artificial Intelligence, Information Processing and Cloud Computing. All rights reserved.},
