	affiliations = {National Agricultural Products Modem Logistics Engineering Technology Research Center, Agricultural Products Shandong, Commerce, China},
	abstract = {The harmonic generated by the internal system and device of the agriculture logistics zone is abbreviated as the internal source harmonic of power quality in this paper. The internal source harmonic usually triggers the mis-operation of devices in the automatic warehouse logistics in the zone, which may increase of damage rate of logistics products and reduce the life span of logistics device severely. It has already reached a consensus that the internal source harmonic control will realize the safe and steady operation of logistics device and effective utilization of power, and further reduce the electric quantity of the zone and relevant costs. Due to the unbalanced production rhythm of agricultural products, and impact of composite factors like the market season and social environment, the production and operation in the zone features dynamics and instability, and it is also difficult to calculate the economic benefit like the powersaving quantity after the harmonic control. At present, there has not been a general quantitative method of power-saving efficiency in the industry, which has restrained the promotion of harmonic control technology to a certain extent. On this basis, this paper attempts to put forward a more systematic harmonic control strategic in the context of the harmonic generated by the internal device of the agriculture logistics zone by integrating effective expert knowledge and experience, and calculate the economic benefit after the harmonic control of the logistics zone rapidly and accurately by combining the power-saving factors and harmonic data of all major nodes in the zone through practical engineering cases, thus to verify the effectiveness of the evaluation on the power-saving efficiency proposed in this paper. © 2018 IEEE.},
